<title>The Philippines: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/philippines/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-philippines-2026-11-06T16:04:54.566Z</guid>
<pubDate>Fri, 06 Nov 2026 16:04:54 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;The Philippine Coast Guard contained an oil spill off Mariveles, Bataan, removing 800 kg of contaminated debris, while the Philippine Navy began probing a reservist for a social media post inciting violence in Manila. China warned it could cut undersea cables linking Taiwan and the Philippines, increased patrols near Taiwan, and a Chinese survey vessel entered Scarborough Shoal with unidentified equipment, raising maritime tension. The Coast Guard deployed the flagship BRP Teresa Magbanua to southeastern Mindanao to intensify maritime patrols and deter illegal activities, and a nationwide earthquake drill tested tsunami preparedness in Cagayan. The conflict remains low-intensity, with 176 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimgFBVV95cUxOOUM3X0N3VUpvYzlYUFdIeWlLc1FGRmUtNmgxNjExcmVzQldxdnNBbmZnMHF2WUZxbzNOOVEyS0FJeURUckhWU29OdGs1a29oSnNsa2ZuOVZ4cENfdWNHcE1NaU0xSi1SYTc3Z2EwZ0N6N2lla2NnV1luNHhwYmtUYWJDRmpFRmxWWmF4SlU2Q3ZzYl9iUU8teEJn?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Southeast Asia Desk&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMieEFVX3lxTE5xQ0hqZW9kbHoxUmlhX0FfS25LQ0gwNEZueGpjTGcxZDlQQzV6VFFMcW1jTE1rZGd6VEh6eDN2SWo4M1N6TWVJMGhtbGh2aUxUOFBnQ09yaE4tTmxUajlXaGtQVkZJeFFGWnFOdWhVTURJQVA1UUFXQg?oc=5&quot;&gt;Inquirer.net&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilwFBVV95cUxNUks1U1RMY2Itc3RjY1Bpd0F4UjNOUUtUUmdNakJZZFhTWEVXRHd1OUVqeXlneG8xQVJLc2N0S0NVV3lNMUs3NWo4bV9xbE9pVllDc28yZnJ0ZU5IU1F1al9ZWlp5RGxwUExaazJESE1fbUJJYzNhY3l2VEJlekdCekp3dWFNa0NaTTlPbFJJSjUxTUxXMUhF?oc=5&quot;&gt;PravdaReport&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinwFBVV95cUxOUlB3WFNUdzhHbTdnT3p6dmVuM045empDM2FqMXM0dWU5NC03Y2N1NWlRUFB1anNjNW5vZzhnOUFiSjdQX1ZFUk40WENhdEFEZWxsaUp0YTFhVExpRmFGbG1KSWd1eklQQzRRTUJvSVVSc2F